 108:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_pwr.c ****   *        possible unwanted write accesses.
 109:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_pwr.c ****   * @note  RTCSEL that sets the RTC clock source selection is in the RTC back-up domain.
 110:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_pwr.c ****   *        In order to set or modify the RTC clock, the backup domain access must be
 111:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_pwr.c ****   *        disabled.
